id: segmented-weight
name: Segmented Weight
kind: crafting
categories: weights
# "Quality Slots: 1~2" - which, asked when it is added.
slots: 1~2
# "For each Quality Slot this Quality occupies, increase the duration of the Doff Bonus for
# doffing this piece of Apparel for the first time in a Combat Encounter by 1 Combat Round."
doffRoundsPerSlot: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  1 or 2 Quality Slots: the first Doff Bonus each Combat Encounter lasts a Combat Round longer
  for each.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: one line to an effect, typed.
summary: >
  passive: Doffed for the first time in a Combat Encounter: its Doff Bonus lasts 1 Combat Round
  longer for each Quality Slot this takes.
text: >
  Segmented Weight: You can remove these weights in increments, or all at once.
  –Apparel Category: Weights
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 1~2
  –Effects: For each Quality Slot this Quality occupies, increase the duration of the Doff
  Bonus for doffing this piece of Apparel for the first time in a Combat Encounter by 1 Combat
  Round.

---

# --- What is built -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Its Slots: 1 or 2, asked when it is added and shown on its row.
#
# --- What is not built ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The Doff Bonus comes with the rest of the Apparel rules. It reads how many Combat Rounds longer
# the first one of an Encounter lasts through doffRounds() in module/gear.mjs - a Round for each
# Slot this takes.
